{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56331","headline":"题古寺 · 周如锡","name":"题古寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梵林岑寂妙圆通，灵籁无声起远钟。\n青鸟梦回天际白，赤鸟翅展海头红。\n晨光灿灿流残月，曙色苍苍散晓风。\n自古洗甚须净地，何须假榻坐禅空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周如锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56331.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56331","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}